                        <characteristic typeId="ct-CmdUnit-Trait" name="Trait">A Date with Death; Mortally wounded at Polotsk, -2 Leader Fate, 1812. Unavailable after August 1812.
A Last Gasp; After being gut shot at Polotsk, Deroy continues to lead his division through the end of the day&apos;s fighting. If severely wounded or killed as a result of Leader Fate, Deroy is not removed, his Command and Ranged Combat Bonuses become +0 and his Contact Combat and Cohesion Bonuses become +3. At the end of the day he is removed permanently.</characteristic>
                        <characteristic typeId="ct-CmdUnit-Avail-Formation" name="AvForm">Early, Mid Wars</characteristic>
                        <characteristic typeId="ct-CmdUnit-Avail-Force" name="AvForce">–</characteristic>
