                        <characteristic typeId="ct-CmdUnit-Trait" name="Trait">By Popular Demand; Craufurd must command the Light Division, 1810-1812.
Black Bob; The Light Division gains Rapid Deployment and either Enthusiastic or Stoic, the controlling player must choose at the start of the game.
Outpost Duty; French Forces within 1 mile (12”) of Light Division may not use dummy Objective markers.
A Date with Death; Craufurd is mortally wounded at Ciudad Rodrigo, dying four days later. -2 to Leader Fate, 1812. Unavailable after January 1812.</characteristic>
                        <characteristic typeId="ct-CmdUnit-Avail-Formation" name="AvForm">Early, Mid Wars</characteristic>
                        <characteristic typeId="ct-CmdUnit-Avail-Force" name="AvForce">–</characteristic>
