                        <characteristic typeId="ct-CmdUnit-Coh" name="Coh">3</characteristic>
                        <characteristic typeId="ct-CmdUnit-Trait" name="Trait">Unfortunate Exile; Despite assisting Napoléon in the coup d’état of 18 Brumaire and retiring in 1801, his wife’s collection of political supporters makes him a credible rival of Napoléon. Premier Consul arranges his banishment from France and exile to the United States with the false claim of Royalist support. Unavailable after 1800.</characteristic>
