                        <characteristic typeId="ct-CmdUnit-Trait" name="Trait">In His Presence; When in Personal Command Aleksandr’s Cmd is +3.
Fate of an Empire; If Aleksandr dies, the Russians lose.
My Life for the Tsar; The Imperatorskaya Leib-Gvardii may not be present unless Aleksandr is present; 1805-1811 &amp; 1813-1814.
I have an Idea!; Aleksandr moves full toward the Army Cmdr during Moves, when in contact causes Cmd -3; 1805, 1813-1814.</characteristic>
