                        <characteristic typeId="ct-CmdUnit-Trait" name="Trait">He Knows People; Invited to Russia by Catherine the Great, who had a positive impression of his brother Maurice, Charles Lambert and his father flee Revolutionary France to join the Russian military where he serves until 1824. Lambert neither triggers nor suﬀers Chistoi Russkoi penalties.
Mass Cavalry; May Convert Cavalry Formations in additional Combats.</characteristic>
