                        <characteristic typeId="ct-CmdUnit-Trait" name="Trait">Not from Around Here; Born in Paris to a noble French family, Langeron flees to Russia at the start of the French Revolution. His defection endears him to the Tsar but not the nobility and Chistoi Russkoi, i.e. “pure” Russians, who see him as competition.</characteristic>
