                        <characteristic typeId="ct-CmdUnit-Trait" name="Trait">Chistoi Russkoi; Command Tests targeting Lavrov subtract, not add, his Command Bonus unless the Commander is also Chistoi Russkoi, or in contact with the Tsar.
Captain of the Guard; May Command Imperatorskaya Leib-Gvardii Forces and Infantry Formations, 1812-1813.
By Popular Demand; The Imperatorskaya Leib-Gvardii must be commanded by Lavrov if Konstantine is not present or is commanding the Army,
1812-1813.
An Unfortunate Death; Lavrov falls ill during the opening of the 1813 campaign and dies in September. Unavailable after June 1813.</characteristic>
