                        <characteristic typeId="ct-CmdUnit-Trait" name="Trait">Not from Around Here; Born in Estonia to a noble German family, Sacken is not of the Russian nobility and often argued with Chistoi Russkoi, i.e. “pure” Russians.
Personal Rivalry; May not be a subordinate of Bennigsen, 1808-1815.</characteristic>
